      "key": "alert_repeat_summarize_threshold_minutes",
      "value": "30",
      "data_type": "string",
      "category": "alerts",
      "environment": "production",
      "description": "After a fingerprint has been firing continuously for this many minutes (now - first_seen_at), the dispatcher escalates to an AI summary that counts repeats, lists time-correlated other alerts in the same window, and produces a paragraph diagnosis. One-shot per fingerprint (marked via summary_dispatched_at). Default 30 min. Glad-Labs/poindexter#420.",
